"section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":67,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":6,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"rensu-q-df10791abb96ff582621","section":"chapter-016","block":"b-d0e228cc642db2a9f79f","layer":"pei","quote":"畿自荆州还，后至许。见侍中耿纪，语终夜","attribution":"裴注·傅子","section_title":"任苏杜郑仓传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0037.xhtml","index":82,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-164a9c6b84cdad2cd0dc","start":10,"end":29,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o188a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1336d4803d0b76311776","layer":"original","quote":"二十三年春正月〖1〗，汉太医令吉本与少府耿纪、司直韦晃等反〖2〗。攻许，烧丞相长史王必营〖3〗。﹝一﹞必与颍川典农中郎将严匡讨斩之〖4〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":396,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p139a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-66e857f79a5f5bdfcda8","layer":"pei","quote":"时有京兆金祎，字德祎。自以世为汉臣，自日䃅讨莽何罗，忠诚显著，名节累叶。睹汉祚将移，谓可季兴；乃喟然发愤，遂与耿纪、韦晃、吉本、本子邈、邈弟穆等结谋。纪字季行。少有美名，为丞相掾，王甚敬异之。迁侍中，守少府。邈字文然，穆字思然；以祎慷慨有日!之风，又与王必善，因以间之。若杀必，欲挟天子以攻魏，南援刘备。","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":418,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5fb0839b137ecdb9b177","start":13,"end":165,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-p140a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1a32db1b9873d963cebe","layer":"pei","quote":"《献帝春秋》曰：“收纪、晃等，将斩之。纪呼魏王名曰：‘恨吾不自生意，竟为群儿所误耳！’晃顿首搏颊，以至于死。”","attribution":"《献帝春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":419,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5fb0839b137ecdb9b177","start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-ac93ccb47f6e7be3aea4","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-ac93ccb47f6e7be3aea4","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二十三年：建安二十三年（公元 218）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":403,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-8cae36984cdc22e48444","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o188","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1336d4803d0b76311776","layer":"original","quote":"二十三年春正月〖1〗，汉太医令吉本与少府耿纪、司直韦晃等反〖2〗。攻许，烧丞相长史王必营〖3〗。﹝一﹞必与颍川典农中郎将严匡讨斩之〖4〗。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":396,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p139","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-66e857f79a5f5bdfcda8","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《三辅决录注》曰：“时有京兆金祎，字德祎。自以世为汉臣，自日䃅讨莽何罗，忠诚显著，名节累叶。睹汉祚将移，谓可季兴；乃喟然发愤，遂与耿纪、韦晃、吉本、本子邈、邈弟穆等结谋。纪字季行。少有美名，为丞相掾，王甚敬异之。迁侍中，守少府。邈字文然，穆字思然；以祎慷慨有日!之风，又与王必善，因以间之。若杀必，欲挟天子以攻魏，南援刘备。时关羽强盛，而王在邺，留必典兵，督许中事。文然等率杂人及家僮千余人，夜烧门攻必。祎遣人为内应，射必中肩。必不知攻者为谁，以素与祎善，走投祎，夜唤‘德祎’。祎家不知是必，谓为文然等，错应曰：‘王长史已死乎？卿曹事立矣！’必乃更他路奔。一曰：必欲投祎，其帐下督谓必曰：‘今日事，竟知谁门而投入乎？’扶必奔南城。会天明，必犹在；文然等众散，故败。后十余日，必竟以创死。”","attribution":"《三辅决录注》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":418,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5fb0839b137ecdb9b177","start":0,"end":347,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-p140","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1a32db1b9873d963cebe","layer":"pei","quote":"《献帝春秋》曰：“收纪、晃等，将斩之。纪呼魏王名曰：‘恨吾不自生意，竟为群儿所误耳！’晃顿首搏颊，以至于死。”","attribution":"《献帝春秋》","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_001.xhtml","index":419,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-5fb0839b137ecdb9b177","start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhonghua-q-432df605c12becfbc358","section":"chapter-013","block":"b-de3f70d0362ef11d699c","layer":"pei","quote":"至二十二年，许中百官，矫制。遇虽不与谋，犹被录诣邺；转为冗散。","attribution":"裴注·魏略","section_title":"钟繇华歆王朗传第十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0031.xhtml","index":514,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-29aaab3281d7871e6af5","start":114,"end":145,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
